at "/demo/notion-qrcode"

// The web host gives a surface no touches: the morph, the spring, the pulse and the haptics are
// the Rust tests' (gpu/src/notion_qrcode.rs, against the RN files run in Hermes); here what the
// Contract holds.
test "the screen and its canvas are there"
